# Christmas Party
## Character Introduction


!KATE (female 40s lead investigator passionate talks like a noir cop)
!TYLER (male 30s man who thinks it's his birthday)
!BENSON (Victim 30s)
!VICTORIA (TYLER's wife, piece of shit)
!RANDY (TYLER's child)
!KELLY (TYLER's Mom)
[[Denial, Anger, Bargaining, Depression]]
## Setup Premise

INT. Tyler's apartment

KATE
(talking to a radio)
That's right sir. This is a 1 8 7. I can barely look at this body. TYLER I'm Detective KATE

TYLER
(Grinning and puts down a cake)
Oh. My. God. This has to be a surprise party. I mean it is my birthday after all

KATE
Sir I'm searching for the perp. Don't worry TYLER I've got my ear to the streets and they are talking

TYLER
I'm so excited right now. BENSON's has always been the biggest joker!

KATE
Sir, there has been a murder. I'm going to need you step back from the body

TYLER
(pauses)
Wait BENSON is dead? Like dead dead?

KATE
That's right sir. His 1986 Nissan Altima is being impounded as we speak

TYLER
No that's crazy we were just on the phone like 3 hours ago

KATE
Sir it's okay to take a breather.
What kind of sick twisted person would do such a thing on Christmas?
How can you even call them a person? It makes me sick

RANDY walks through the door. Carrying a bag of family size Fritos

RANDY
Hey dad! I'm home from soccer. We had some leftover Fritos at prac...

KATE
There has been a murder, I'm going to need you take a step back from the body

TYLER
BENSON is dead RANDY

RANDY
Wait Uncle BENSON is dead? Like dead dead?

KATE
That's right. His 1986 Nissan Altima is being impounded as we speak

RANDY
Oh no! I need to go to my room! Uncle BENSON was the best man I have ever known

TYLER
(a tear runs down)
RANDY come back! BENSON that asshole! I hate him for abandoning me! I loved him like a brother

KATE
Leave him TYLER. This will grow him up too much too soon. Don't want him ending up like me

TYLER
Thank you KATE. This is so much right now. I need to keep a level head

KATE
Don't worry TYLER. I'm not going to sleep, not while this body is cold and the perp is still out there. This disgusts me.

VICTORIA walks through the door, talking on the phone. Carrying a bottle of 2001 Screaming Eagle Cabernet

VICTORIA
Uh huh. Oh yeah? Whatever you want Boss. I'm here for you. Hey honey, have you seen RANDY?

KATE
He is in his room. Ma'am I'm going to need you take a step back from the body

VICTORIA
Body? OH MY GOD! BENSON! 

TYLER
BENSON is dead VICTORIA

VICTORIA
BENSON is dead? Like dead dead?

KATE
That's right. His 1986 Nissan Altima is being impounded as we speak

VICTORIA
Oh god that's so terrible

TYLER tries to hug VICTORIA

VICTORIA (CONT'D)
(walks past TYLER)
BENSON was the **best** man I have ever known!

TYLER
I know exactly what you mean honey

VICTORIA
(pauses)
You do?

TYLER
(Slumped over, sitting in a chair)
Yeah. I'd give anything to bring back BENSON. He was my compadre. My comrade. My captain

VICTORIA
Oh yeah. That. I'm going to put this bottle down in the kitchen

TYLER
VICTORIA come back please? She's my rock. The person I know that would stand by my side through thick and thin

KATE
Don't worry TYLER. I'll keep knocking on trouble's door even if trouble knocks back. It makes me sick

KELLY walks through the door, singing happy birthday and carrying a tray of ribeyes

KELLY
...hday to you! Happy birthday dear TYLER! Happy birthday to you!

TYLER
(barely holding it together)
Hey mom

KELLY
What's wrong dear? Where's BENSON?

KATE
Ma'am there has been a murder, I'm going to need you to take a step a back from the body

KELLY
A murder? Where's? BENSON!!!

KATE
That's right. His 1986 Nissan Altima is being impounded as we speak

KELLY	
Not the Altima!!

TYLER
I just don't know how to go on Mom. Please if you have any words of advice. BENSON's was my best friend. My only friend

KELLY
Oh TYLER. I don't know. He was like a son to me

KATE
Sometimes you have to become a monster to catch one. Let me be your monster TYLER. Let me find this perp

TYLER
(Near breaking)
Excuse everyone I need to leave

TYLER rushes out the door

KATE
This case has found a sickness and I won't rest until I found a cure

KATE leaves. A brief silence fills the room

BENSON
Is he gone?

Everyone starting sighing relief

KELLY
Man I hate him so much

VICTORIA	
Oh thank god. I'm literally shaking

RANDY
I hope he doesn't bother us anymore!

KELLY
Talk about a mistake on so many levels!

VICTORIA	
Oh man finally we did this! On his birthday nonetheless! He'll need years of therapy!

RANDY
Bring out the cake **DAD**

KELLY
Oh don't worry about it. I got it BENSON

KELLY brings a slice for everyone

BENSON
Aw man vanilla? I wanted chocolate

